OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FTalented young soloists, violinist
OL,7,     FLudvig Gudim and pianist Valdemar
OL,8,     FWenzel Most perform a recital at
OL,9,     Fthe church in Nyborg, Denmark.
OL,10,G0630 Breakfast
OL,11,     FTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,15,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,16,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,17,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,18,     Fwith familiar favourites.
