OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Prokofiev,
OL,9,     Fchamber performances from this
OL,10,     Fyear's Ryedale Festival and
OL,11,     FBaroque music from Fribourg.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,13,     FKate Molleson explores Mozart's
OL,14,     Frelationship with his sister
OL,15,     FNannerl, from their close bond in
OL,16,     Fchildhood to estrangement by the
OL,17,     Fend of their lives.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FFolk band Pons Aelius play live.
OL,20,     FTom Fetherstonhaugh on conducting
OL,21,     Fthe Fantasia Orchestra at his
OL,22,     Fforthcoming BBC Prom.
