OL,6,     FLive at the BBC Proms: BBC
OL,7,     FNational Orchestra of Wales,
OL,8,     Fconductor Elena Schwarz and Alina
OL,9,     FIbragimova perform Mendelssohn's
OL,10,     FViolin Concerto in E minor.
OL,11,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,12,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Feverything in between.
OL,17,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,18,     FLondon-based vocalist and
OL,19,     Fviolinist Alice Zawadzki, sitting
OL,20,     Fin for Soweto Kinch, spotlights
OL,21,     Fsome of the new jazz releases and
OL,22,     Fclassics that she appreciates.
